tinf 1.2.1 integration notice
============================

The files in this directory are derived from Joergen Ibsen's tinf 1.2.1 and
remain under the zlib license carried in their source headers.

These are altered source versions for uniLoader:

* tinf.h: reduced to the API used by the boot-time gzip decoder.
* tinflate.c: comments/test harness trimmed for the freestanding loader; the
  inflate algorithm is unchanged.
* tinfgzip.c: comments/formatting trimmed and bounds checks expressed in forms
  suitable for the freestanding build.
* crc32.c: formatting only.
* assert.h: uniLoader shim which compiles tinf's internal assertions out because
  the loader has no libc assertion handler.

Original project: https://github.com/jibsen/tinf
